                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " Located near Kolhapur, Panhala is one of the largest forts in the Deccan. It holds a pivotal place in Maratha history due to the great ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "Siege of Panhala"
                      ]
                    },
                    " in 1660, led by the Adilshahi general Siddi Jauhar. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-en"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " Trapped for months, Shivaji Maharaj devised a brilliant strategy. On a dark, rainy night, he made a daring escape toward Vishalgad, aided by the supreme sacrifice of the decoy Shiva Kashid and the valiant last stand of Baji Prabhu Deshpande at Pavan Khind. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " कोल्हापूर जवळील पन्हाळगड हा दख्खनमधील सर्वात मोठ्या किल्ल्यांपैकी एक आहे. १६६० साली आदिलशाही सरदार सिद्धी जोहरने या गडाला घातलेला ",
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "props": {},
                      "children": [
                        "ऐतिहासिक वेढा"
                      ]
                    },
                    " मराठा इतिहासात अत्यंत थरारक मानला जातो. "
                  ]
                },
                " ",
                {
                  "tag": "p",
                  "props": {
                    "className": "lang-mr-text deva-body"
                  },
                  "children": [
                    " अनेक महिने वेढ्यात अडकल्यानंतर, एका अंधाऱ्या आणि पावसाळी रात्री महाराजांनी विशाळगडाकडे धाडसी कूच केली. यावेळी शिवा काशिद यांचे बलिदान आणि बाजीप्रभू देशपांडे यांनी पावनखिंडीत दिलेला अभूतपूर्व लढा स्वराज्यासाठी अमर ठरला. "
                  ]
                },
                " "
